### 10.1 대용량 뉴스 조회 (최대 50개)
GET {{baseUrl}}/news/recent?limit=50

### 10.2 복잡한 검색 쿼리
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/news?q=정치%20경제%20사회%20문화&category=ALL&bias=all&sort=relevance&page=1&size=50

### 10.3 대용량 크롤링 요청 (Heavy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/news/crawl/naver
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "officeId": "001",
  "categoryId": "100",
  "maxArticles": 100,
  "maxScrollAttempts": 30,
  "sessionId": "stress_test_001"
}

